/**
 * Systems.astro — Phase 4B
 *
 * The evidence layer of Verk (docs 16, phase-4a/4b reports). Replaces the
 * `#proyectos` placeholder. Row list, not a grid or a logo wall — identical
 * structural principle to Services.astro and Method.astro so the section can
 * hold 9, 20, or 100 systems without redesign (doc 16, Part 6).
 *
 * Order, taxonomy, ranking, state language, and per-system architecture layers
 * are locked in docs/16-systems-architecture.md and docs/project-content/*.md.
 * This file only translates that narrative into markup — see phase-4b-report.md
 * for the reasoning behind every decision below.
 *
 * Section label: "Sistemas" (doc 16, Part 3) — one word, matching Servicios/Método.
 * Headline: "El problema cambia. / El método no." — callback to the Método section,
 * chosen specifically to avoid repeating "sistema" directly under a label that
 * already says "Sistemas."
 *
 * data-reveal intentionally omitted — same precedent as Services/Method; the
 * IntersectionObserver activation is still pending in the generic Phase 4 queue.
 */

