---

<section class="systems section section-light" id="proyectos" aria-label="Sistemas">

  <!-- Isotipo — structural background mark, top-left (Services used top-right,
       Method used bottom-right — varying the corner keeps repetition from
       feeling mechanical across sections, per doc 11 Part 5). -->
  <div class="systems-isotipo" aria-hidden="true">
    <img
      src="/images/isotipo.png"
      alt=""
      width="600"
      height="600"
      draggable="false"
      decoding="async"
    />
  </div>

  <div class="container systems-container">

    <header class="systems-header">
      <p class="text-label systems-lbl">Sistemas</p>
      <h2 class="systems-headline">
        <span class="systems-line">El problema cambia.</span>
        <span class="systems-line">El método no.</span>
      </h2>
      <p class="systems-intro">
        Nueve problemas distintos: narración, prospección, taxonomía, automatización, percepción.
        Ninguno se resolvió con una plantilla: cada uno empezó por entender cómo funciona, antes de construir nada.
      </p>
    </header>

    <ol class="systems-list" role="list">
      {systems.map((s) => (
        <li>
          <SystemEntry {...s} />
        </li>
      ))}
    </ol>

  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .systems {
    overflow: hidden;
  }

  .systems-isotipo {
    position: absolute;
    top: -6%;
    left: -8%;
    width: clamp(260px, 32vw, 480px);
    opacity: 0.05;
    pointer-events: none;
    user-select: none;
    z-index: 0;
  }

  .systems-isotipo img {
    display: block;
    width: 100%;
    height: auto;
    mix-blend-mode: multiply;
  }

  .systems-container {
    position: relative;
    z-index: 1;
  }

  .systems-header {
    max-width: 640px;
    margin-bottom: var(--space-16);
  }

  .systems-lbl {
    display: block;
    margin-bottom: var(--space-5);
  }

  .systems-headline {
    margin: 0 0 var(--space-8);
    font-family: var(--font-display);
    font-weight: var(--weight-bold);
    line-height: var(--leading-tight);
    letter-spacing: var(--tracking-tight);
    color: var(--color-ink);
  }

  .systems-line {
    display: block;
    font-size: clamp(2.25rem, 1.2rem + 4.5vw, 5.5rem);
  }

  .systems-intro {
    font-family: var(--font-body);
    font-size: var(--text-lg);
    line-height: var(--leading-relaxed);
    color: var(--color-grey-mid);
    margin: 0;
    max-width: 520px;
  }

  .systems-list {
    list-style: none;
    margin: 0;
    padding: 0;
  }

  @media (max-width: 768px) {
    .systems-isotipo {
      width: 70vw;
      left: -18%;
      top: -2%;
      opacity: 0.04;
    }

    .systems-intro {
      max-width: 100%;
    }
  }

  @media (max-width: 480px) {
    .systems-isotipo {
      display: none;
    }
  }
</style>
